\sigma(\lambda t)+\frac{1}{\lambda-1}\sigma(\lambda t)&=&\frac{\lambda}{\lambda-1}\sigma(\lambda t)
\\&=&
\frac{\lambda}{\lambda-1}\frac{1}{\lambda t}\int_0^{\lambda t}s(x)dx
\\&=&
