s_{\alpha}^+(x)\geq s_{\alpha}^+(t)-\varepsilon
\end{eqnarray*}
and then $s(x)\succeq s(t)-\overline{\varepsilon}$ holds whenever $x_0< t<x\leq \lambda t$.
